      "id": "the-seven-things-a-full-tax-invoice-must-show",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "10e65380ab1253ac",
      "text": "Die sewe dinge wat ’n volledige belastingfaktuur moet wys"
    },
    {
      "c": [
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "Vir enige lewering bo R5,000:"
        }
      ],
      "hash": "57041b6bbda9a490",
      "id": "the-seven-things-a-full-tax-invoice-must-show.1",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "6bc0120a90e3c185"
    },
    {
      "hash": "45af86d0f60272a7",
      "id": "the-seven-things-a-full-tax-invoice-must-show.2",
      "items": [
        [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "Die woorde \"Belastingfaktuur\" (\"Tax Invoice\"), \"BTW-faktuur\" (\"VAT Invoice\") of \"Faktuur\" (\"Invoice\")"
          }
        ],
        [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "Jou naam, adres en BTW-registrasienommer"
          }
        ],
        [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "Die kliënt se naam en adres, en hulle BTW-nommer as hulle geregistreer is"
          }
        ],
        [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "’n Volgnommer en die uitreikdatum"
          }
        ],
        [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "’n Beskrywing van die goedere of dienste wat gelewer is"
          }
        ],
        [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "Die hoeveelheid of volume wat gelewer is"
          }
        ],
        [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "Die waarde van die lewering, die BTW wat gehef is, en die totaal"
          }
        ]
      ],
      "kind": "list",
      "ordered": true,
      "sourceHash": "40c9e125d3aff4c3",
      "start": 1
    },
    {
      "c": [
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "Werk met 15%"
        }
      ],
      "depth": 2,
      "hash": "7d13ed3038bbc1a3",
      "id": "working-with-15",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "166b2440c381a8d1",
      "text": "Werk met 15%"
    },
    {
      "c": [
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "Om BTW by ’n prys te tel, vermenigvuldig met 1.15. Om die BTW in ’n prys wat BTW insluit te vind, vermenigvuldig met 15/115."
        }
      ],
      "hash": "7f0c73c9bfd057f6",
      "id": "working-with-15.1",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "3da10cd97b9855d0"
    },
    {
      "c": [
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "As jy tweedehandse goedere verkoop, moet die beskrywing dit sê."
